(The Ant Tool Change - fixed tool setter)
(Tool length is measured on the setter, the work zero is not modified)
(Homing is required: the G53 moves use absolute machine positions)
G21
G49
@SPINDLE_STOP@
G4 P@SPINDLE_DWELL@
G53 G00 Z@SAFE_POS_Z@
@SETTER_TYPE_POS@
G00 X@SETTER_POS_X@ Y@SETTER_POS_Y@ F@PROBE_FEED_XY@
G38.2 Z@PROBE_POS_MIN@ F@PROBE_FEED_FAST@
G91 G00 Z@PROBE_BACKOFF@
G90
G38.2 Z@PROBE_POS_MIN@ F@PROBE_FEED_SLOW@
G53 G00 Z@SAFE_POS_Z@
G53 G00 X@CHANGE_POS_X@
G53 G00 Y@CHANGE_POS_Y@
M0 (Change the tool, then press Cycle Start)
@SETTER_TYPE_POS@
G00 X@SETTER_POS_X@ Y@SETTER_POS_Y@ F@PROBE_FEED_XY@
G38.2 Z@PROBE_POS_MIN@ F@PROBE_FEED_FAST@
G91 G00 Z@PROBE_BACKOFF@
G90
G38.2 Z@PROBE_POS_MIN@ F@PROBE_FEED_SLOW@
G43.1 Z@TLO_TYPE_A@
G53 G01 Z@SAFE_POS_Z@ F@PROBE_FEED_FAST@
G54
G01 F@PROBE_FEED_XY@
G00 X@PRE_POS_X@ Y@PRE_POS_Y@
G00 Z@PRE_POS_Z@
@SPINDLE_START@
